flowchart TD
  A[Open admin login] --> B[Firebase email/password]
  B --> C{admins/uid exists?}
  C -->|No| D[Sign out, access denied]
  C -->|Yes| E[Operations Dashboard]
  E --> F[Brand and Product Inventory]
  E --> IC[Ingredient Curator]
  F --> G[Choose / drop import file]
  G --> H[Extract text, optional AI draft]
  H --> I[Stage Pending records]
  I --> J{Admin approves, edits or rejects}
  J -->|Approve| K[Status set to Active]
  J -->|Reject| L[Removed / sent to Recycle bin]
  F --> N[Move to Recycle Bin]
  N --> O{Restore or Archive?}
  O -->|Restore| F
  O -->|Archive| P[Archive, kept 30 days]
  P --> Q{Restore to bin, or delete now}
  Q --> R[Daily purge job deletes expired entries]

  noteC["IF the signed-in Firebase UID has no admins/uid document, sign out and deny access"]
  C -.- noteC
  noteJ["IF a field import or AI draft needs review, the admin approves, edits, or rejects it before it goes live"]
  J -.- noteJ
  noteQ["IF 30 days pass with no restore, the daily purge job deletes the archived entry"]
  Q -.- noteQ
  class noteC,noteJ,noteQ note
  classDef note fill:#fffbe6,stroke:#d4b106,stroke-width:1px,color:#5c4a00,font-size:11px
